Do not send passwords, payment-card details or unnecessary sensitive information.
Correcting your path
Connect neighbouring numbers horizontally, vertically or diagonally. Lines cannot cross.

Trace backward over the last segment to remove it. You can also tap Undo to remove the last selected number, or Clear path to begin again on the same puzzle.

Restart level generates a fresh puzzle.
Hints
Players receive three free hints. After those are used, the Hint button attempts to show a video advertisement.

The hint is still granted if the video is skipped, fails or is unavailable. Each hint displays a complete equation.

Completing levels or restarting the game does not refill the initial free-hint balance.
Premium purchases
Premium is a one-time purchase that provides unlimited hints and removes advertisements. It is not a subscription.

To restore an existing purchase:
1. Open Settings in Sum Trail.
2. Select Restore purchases.
3. Use the same Apple Account that made the original purchase.
If restoration fails, check your internet connection and contact support.

Apple handles App Store payments and refund requests. To request a refund, visit:

https://reportaproblem.apple.com/
Saved progress
Game progress and preferences are stored on your device. Sum Trail does not require an account or provide a developer-operated cloud-sync service.

Deleting the app can remove your local progress. Device backups and restoration depend on your Apple settings.

